"text":"LULC classification"},{"type":"note","label":"Project 4","text":"Transport accessibility analysis"},{"type":"note","label":"Project 5","text":"Population/infrastructure dashboard"},{"type":"note","label":"Project 6","text":"Remote-sensing project"},{"type":"note","label":"Project 7","text":"PostGIS spatial database"},{"type":"note","label":"Project 8","text":"Interactive Web GIS application"},{"type":"p","text":"For each project document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem"},{"text":"Dataset"},{"text":"Coordinate reference system"},{"text":"Tools"},{"text":"Processing"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Maps"},{"text":"Findings"},{"text":"Limitations"},{"text":"Recommendations"}]}]},{"heading":"PG Study Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA Geography graduate can strengthen the GIS pathway through:"},{"type":"h","text":"Direct options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA/MSc Geography"},{"text":"MSc GIS"},{"text":"MSc Geoinformatics"},{"text":"MSc Remote Sensing & GIS"},{"text":"Master's in Geospatial Science"},{"text":"MSc Geospatial Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interdisciplinary options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban Planning"},{"text":"Environmental Science"},{"text":"Disaster Management"},{"text":"Remote Sensing"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Spatial Data Science"},{"text":"Geoinformatics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technically focused GIS career, a GIS/Geoinformatics/Remote Sensing specialisation can be more directly valuable than a purely theoretical postgraduate geography degree."},{"type":"h","text":"Government & Research Route"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS skills are useful across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban development"},{"text":"Land administration"},{"text":"Surveying and mapping"},{"text":"Environment"},{"text":"Forests"},{"text":"Agriculture"},{"text":"Disaster management"},{"text":"Transport"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Water resources"},{"text":"Census/demographic analysis"},