:"Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","PostgreSQL/PostGIS","Statistics","Power BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","GeoPandas","Rasterio","Shapely"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"flow","items":["Web GIS","Spatial Data Science","Machine Learning","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Target Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"BA Year 1"},{"text":"Geography + cartography foundation"}],[{"text":"BA Year 2"},{"text":"GIS/remote-sensing student"}],[{"text":"BA Year 3"},{"text":"GIS/Geospatial internship + portfolio"}],[{"text":"After BA"},{"text":"GIS Technician / Junior GIS Analyst / Mapping Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–4 years"},{"text":"GIS Analyst / Geospatial Analyst"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Senior GIS Analyst / Spatial Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"7–12 years"},{"text":"GIS Lead / Geospatial Specialist / GIS Developer"}],[{"text":"12–20 years"},{"text":"GIS Manager / Geospatial Consultant / Solutions Architect"}],[{"text":"Long term"},{"text":"Geospatial Technology Lead / Principal Geospatial Specialist"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For BA Geography → GIS Analyst, the degree provides the domain foundation, but employability depends heavily on technical GIS capability and a demonstrable portfolio."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Geography","QGIS/ArcGIS","Remote Sensing","Python + SQL/PostGIS","GIS Internship","Junior GIS Analyst","GIS Analyst","Senior Geospatial Analyst"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a future-ready profile, add:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS","Remote Sensing","Python","Spatial Databases","Web GIS","Geospatial AI/ML"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination can open opportunities across urban planning, environmental consulting, infrastructure, agriculture, disaster management, logistics, utilities, telecom, government, research and geospatial technology companies."}]}]}